{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_st01","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-ST-1","storyName":"涉过寒夜","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"一间破旧的酒馆里，一位作家讲述着一个残缺不全的故事：贪婪的红龙唤醒了早已死去的放逐王，而她高尚的妹妹正带领友人们回归塔拉的首府纳斯尔纱。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_st01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_st01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"next":1,"characters":["作家","？？？","神秘的女性","红龙","“放逐王”","衰朽的老人","拉芙希妮","塔拉流民","莫兰","“校官”","“守灵人”","严肃的守灵人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read1","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_weaamonologue_1","channel":"read1","loop":"false","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>为了夺回被仇敌侵占的王国，贪婪的红龙找到盘踞在林中的黑雾帮助自己。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>红龙喷吐死亡的火焰，黑雾将仇敌赶入火中。他们合力夺回了王国，让原本荆棘丛生的原野重新焕发了生机。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>可死火在原野上蔓延开来，整片原野和原野上的居民都在不知不觉中衰败下去，新生命连连夭折，死者却无法安寝。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>红龙不能容忍死亡不受控制、自行蔓延，她要让生命归生命，死亡归死亡。为此，她在夏末节前，将被死火侵染的人们聚集到自己的巢穴。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","id":16},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"2","channel":"read1","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":24},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read1","fadetime":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......这就是红龙的故事。","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"接下来呢？那些被死火侵染的人怎么样了？","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"没有什么接下来，书上就是这么写的。","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这不合理。","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"一切都有个尽头，不管这个尽头看起来是否合理，小姐。","id":31},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":37},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"这也不是您选择在作品出版后销声匿迹，在这样一间破败的酒馆里藏身的理由。太荒谬了。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"荒谬的事还多着呢。","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您就这么喜欢吊人胃口吗？冷眼旁观那些急着知道结局的读者，从中获取心灵上的满足？","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"之前倒确实有几位尽责得过了头的信使找到了这里，把读者的信给我送了过来。","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您果然以此为乐。","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"以此为乐？我看都不去看，直接把信扔进那边的火炉里。","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"真过分。","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"不仅如此，您发表的故事集里就没有一个故事是没被截断的，太过分了。","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"很简单，我不知道该写什么。我写不出结局。","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"请回吧，小姐。你显然是个受过良好教育的人，这间粗俗的酒馆不适合你，这几个半截子的故事也不至于让你如此费心。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"为什么这么急着下逐客令呢？或许我可以帮您一把。","id":61},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"text","text":"作家重新打量起眼前的人。即便有兜帽作为遮挡，自己也能看到她面色苍白，想必十分虚弱。","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"这个人一来这座荒村就直奔这家酒馆，来之前显然做了不少调查，看来一时半会儿打发不掉。","id":67},{"type":"text","text":"作家这么想着，从散落着纸牌和筹码的桌子上抓起黏糊糊的杯子，往嘴里灌了一大口发馊的啤酒。","id":68},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","volume":"0.6","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"那好，你打算给这个故事一个什么样的结局？","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"为什么是我来给呢？","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"作者毕竟是您，我只想给您提供一些或许能点燃灵感的素材。","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"素材？","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"去年秋天，你也从那座城市死里逃生？","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"毕竟只要是经历过的人都看得出，您的故事正是以那段时日为蓝本。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"那就请吧。我等着听你的素材。","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":88},{"type":"bg","duration":"2.5","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"那么，在早已被天灾摧毁的塔拉王城旧址最深处......","id":91},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ghosthunter_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ghosthunter_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":98,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"在早已被天灾摧毁的塔拉王城旧址最深处，金属炉中的火焰在某个短暂而安宁的日子被人熄灭。","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"这本不是什么要紧事，但红龙仍然来到了这里。","id":103},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"1.5","keep":"true","initamount":"0.7","amount":"0","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","duration":"1","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_ignite_cast","volume":"0.6","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.3","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"在抗拒被点燃？","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"还是说，即便是数百年后另一位不祥的异类，也不能重燃被时光腐蚀殆尽的渴求与怨恨？","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"或者，我只是太过拘谨了？","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_deathfire","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_eblana_attack","layer":"1","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":128},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0.3","loop":"true","channel":"bse","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"紫色的火焰腾地烧到炉外。","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"而在火焰的映照下，红龙的脸色分明比方才苍白了几分。","id":132},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bse","fadetime":"2","id":134},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$2","duration":"1","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"睡醒了吗？","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"或者，需不需要我提醒你的身份......","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"抛下王冠在荒野上行走二十年，却仍在归来时被至亲杀害的可怜红龙，拉布雷德，“放逐王”？","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"真可怜，一位六百年后仍为自己的横死而震惊的人。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"六百年？","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"只是估算。你死亡的确切年份已经不为人知。","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我的确很震惊，不过不是因为横死，而是原来六百年过去，德拉克之中又出了一条喷吐死火的异种。","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"他们甚至还让你长大成人，没把你扼杀于襁褓之中。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"维多利亚人让你来把我从死亡中唤醒？或者，你自己的卧室床底下就藏着维多利亚人那傻里傻气的宝冠？","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"维多利亚已不是红龙执掌的国度，如今的塔拉也不再听从任何外来者的号令。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哈，不坏。","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"那看来现在是流行向死者报喜了？真可惜，我没什么能赏你的，你该走了。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"你身上现在燃烧着我的火，只讲几句不着边际的话是不可能了事的，拉布雷德。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"了事？我的事情早就了了。有事未了的，难道不是你吗？","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"......","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我懂，我都懂。毕竟是死火嘛，招来的麻烦都差不多。生与死混杂不清，老去的兽群死而不僵，新生的幼兽却早早夭折。","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"说吧，捅了多大的娄子？一个牧场？一座城市？一片原野？","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"我用火点燃了整个塔拉，让它从维多利亚的铁蹄下获得了自由。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你？！","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"让这火就这么烧下去，让塔拉化作死者的国度，反正死火自会寻找新的柴薪，我本来是这么想的。","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"可倘若只是因为无计可施，就让如此之多的生命从此消逝，未免失之草率。","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"因此，我来问问你，若是要将死火从塔拉的原野上一扫而空，又该做些什么？","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......但愿你这些话只是虚张声势。","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"任凭你想象。","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"听好了，我接下来的指点不是为了你，而是为了仍愿意以塔拉为名的人们。","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"已经被你的火沾染而走向死亡的，生命只会背弃他们，不会回归。","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你背后的行尸当然要算在内，那些虽还活着，却已如同行尸走肉的人，他们也已经无药可救。","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"去把他们聚集到一起，别再让火焰沾染任何人。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"姑息，这就是你能给出的建议？","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"呵......怎么会呢？","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"接下来，去找到另一条红龙吧，假如你的亲族还没被你屠戮殆尽的话。","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"找到一条能用火焰温暖生命的真正的红龙，让尘归尘，土归土，生命归于生命，死亡归于死亡。","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"这就是你知道的一切？","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"是啊，无知的幼龙。","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"那么，看来你所知的也并不比我更多。","id":203},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_bg_34_g4_swamp_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"红龙甚至没有费心留下一声冷笑，只是转身离开。","id":212},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","duration":"0.7","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"她经过一栋破败的房屋，其中隐隐透出橘黄色的烛光。","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"这是死者徘徊的旷野，本不该有人烟。也正因此，她敲响了小屋的门。","id":218},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"您是？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"我是谁并不重要，重要的是，你为什么住在这里？","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"以前我住在这里，只因为这里不会有维多利亚人敲响我的门，夺走我从土里刨出的粮食和积蓄......","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"五年以前，也是这样一个晚上，一位邪恶的术师经过这里，杀死了步步紧逼的维多利亚人。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"我向术师献上兽肉、谷粒和新酿的浊酒，可他告诉我，他不需要这些，他需要的是火，甘愿把自己燃尽，成为薪柴的火。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"于是，我的独子，基斯，跟着他离开了家。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"多么高尚的灵魂。","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"而三年之后，还是晚上，又有人敲响这扇门。是基斯。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"是我已经不会说话，不会哭泣，甚至不会呼吸，只有身上冒出紫火的基斯。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"真不幸。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"而这不幸还没抵达终点。我埋葬了基斯，可他不愿在土中腐烂，反而拖着已死的身躯，在荒原上无尽地游荡。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"这就是我现在还住在这里的原因。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"你是那位术师的同道吗？你是来给基斯以安宁的吗？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"是啊......","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"哦，他自己来了。","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwlstps","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"dw","id":252},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"4","channel":"dw","id":253},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"一具燃着任谁都能看见的紫火的行尸，晃晃悠悠地朝着二人走来。","id":255},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","volume":"0.8","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"0.8","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"75","g":"0","b":"130","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"75","g":"0","b":"130","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"75","g":"0","b":"130","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"红龙用枪尖抵住那具身躯的胸口，整具身躯熊熊燃烧起来，一眨眼的工夫就燃烧殆尽，化为灰烬。","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"可老人觉得一阵恍惚，仿佛那火不是燃尽了，而是顺着枪尖流回了红龙身上。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"那么你呢？你也沾染上了那紫色的死火，不是吗？","id":269},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"老人看向自己周身，并未看到像独子身上那样的烈焰。可在红龙眼中，他身上的火焰烧得甚至比死者还要旺些。","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"......如果你说的是悲伤、愤怒与仇恨，那么是的，女巫。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"维多利亚人征税以金币，而你们征税以血，你们共同从我身上夺走了一切。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"我早已是一具空壳，支撑我站立在此的，唯有你所谓的火焰。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"那么，我要将你的火焰收回来了，你意下如何？","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"这一天早该来了。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"老人闭上双眼，迎向红龙的枪尖。","id":284},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firecut","volume":"0.7","id":286},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"他真的感到，一直支撑着自己的那团悲伤与愤怒的火，正向着红龙的手汩汩流出，而与之一同离开身体的，还有他浑浊的意识。","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"他预感到死亡将至，但既然他的生活早已停滞，死亡也早就不再可怖。","id":290},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firemag_n","volume":"0.6","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"可火焰突然停止了流动。","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衰朽的老人","text":"为什么？为什么不杀死我？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1254_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"因为你已经不必被杀死了。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"一个幽魂告诉我，生命已不会再眷顾沾染了死火的人，现在看来，他是对的。","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":305},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":307},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":308,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"false","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"“现在看来，他是对的。”红龙冷淡地答道。","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"这一段这样作结如何？我从那位老人口中听到了这样的事，加上一点创作，我想，就算放在您的故事里，也不显得突兀了。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"在故事里加上那位传说中的放逐王的鬼魂......是吗？","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"也许能行吧，不过你真的还需要我故事的结局吗？","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您眼里看到的东西显然与我有别。我需要从您的眼睛看，从您的耳朵听。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"难道你是那种喜欢“拼凑真相”的无聊家伙？","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"我从不觉得真相无聊。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"哈，看在我们俩至少都活着从那个地方出来的分上，我可以把那些观察、灵感和写作过程中废掉的文本一股脑抛给你。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"但那几个故事的结局究竟如何，我无法保证。","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"既然你刚刚讲的是红龙......那我也从红龙开始，怎么样？","id":328},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"charslot","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","loop":"false","channel":"1","delay":"1.2","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"作家又往肚子里灌了半杯啤酒，略带挑衅地看了眼前的女性一眼，随后开始讲述。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"text","text":"如果你曾去过那条红龙名为纳斯尔纱的巢穴，哪怕只是几天，你都不会忘了那片黑林。","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"它阴暗潮湿，黑雾弥漫，里面住满了捉弄人的精怪，就像一座漆黑的迷宫。","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"据说，除非黑林允许，否则进入其中的人，没有一个能够出来。","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"而当黑林允许你通过，愿意为你打开的时候，尽管那些捉弄人的精怪仍会把你带上歧途，嘲笑你的笨拙，但他们最终放你离开时......","id":342},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":344},{"type":"image","image":"59_i01","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","y":"-30","id":345},{"type":"background","id":346},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"-30","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"0.85","yScaleTo":"0.85","duration":"35","block":"false","id":347},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"它会美得像一幅画，一幅不该存在于这个世上的画。","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"而红龙，带着一路跟她走来的人们，却毫无犹豫地踏入巢穴的范围，把那美丽的景致抛在脑后。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红龙","text":"纳斯尔纱，塔拉之心，“红龙的巢穴”......","id":356},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"subtitle","text":"嗯？你问我，“哪条红龙”？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":359},{"type":"subtitle","text":"看来你的确喜欢“拼凑真相”。觉得我当你什么都不知道，在刻意误导你了，是吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":360},{"type":"subtitle","text":"既然你懂得这么多，我也就没必要再拐弯抹角了，不是吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":361},{"type":"subtitle","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":365},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0.7","amount":"0","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":367},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":368,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"纳斯尔纱，塔拉之心，“红龙的巢穴”......我们终于到了。","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"天啊，从石高原野一路到这儿，真的像做了一场好长好长的梦......我真的能把家安在这里？","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这里也不仅有田园牧歌。","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"塔拉的首府确实没有直接介入伦蒂尼姆的战火，可纳斯尔纱附近，低烈度的渗透和贵族叛乱就从来没停过。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"尤其是在红龙带领军队向伦蒂尼姆进军之后......说这里打了一场局部战争也不为过。","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"抱歉啊，苇草，我单纯就是心里高兴，没别的意思！","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，回家......是该高兴一些的。","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"莫兰，你听过什么歌唱这座城市、这片黑林的歌谣吗？","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"只有一首，并不是很应景......","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"唱吧，莫兰！","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾♪","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"踏上通往战场的路途♪","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"没有笛声，没有战鼓♪","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"唯有身后钟声，穿过雾中的水珠♪","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"回来的路上，我一直想给这首曲子再填上一段词，但没什么灵感。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"苇草，你看起来似乎更担心了。是这首歌太悲伤的缘故吗？","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，和这首歌没关系。这是一首很好的歌。","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我只是......","id":387},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮没有再说下去。","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"在她们身后，流民们一个接一个地走出黑林。","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"和跃动着斑斓色彩的胜景相比，眼前的纳斯尔纱不免显得呆板而黯淡。然而，除了拉芙希妮，没人在意这些。","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"他们只知道，他们终究走完了这漫长的旅途，他们终于跋涉到了旅途的终点。","id":392},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"他们回到了家。","id":395},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"image","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"接下来我们怎么办？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"会有人来接应我们的。等见到他们——","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":413},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2.5","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮看见人影从城市的方向缓缓走来。","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"那只能是迎接他们的人，可上次见面时，他还要杀死她。","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"她下意识地展开双手，去护住身侧的莫兰。","id":418},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":420},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......你为什么在这里？","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"我来迎接您。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"什么？","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"我会护送您进入纳斯尔纱，与爱布拉娜殿下会面。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"在这之后，如非必要，您不会再见到我。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"的确，不见面就能解决的问题，我和她都已经在“加斯特里尔”号上解决了。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"那就请跟我来。至于其余的人......出于安全考虑，我会另外安排。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不行。他们都是塔拉同胞，他们得和我一同进城。我答应过他们。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"我很希望能满足您的愿望，但实话说，城内的绝大多数同胞可不知道还有您这么一条红龙。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我保证他们会保守秘密。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"这就是您和殿下的不同。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你是说，姐姐会“确保”他们保守秘密？","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"......","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这就是为什么我要带他们进纳斯尔纱。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":453},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.8","channel":"step1","loop":"false","id":454},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step1","fadetime":"2","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":456},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呃......我有一个或许足以两全的办法，您愿意听听吗？","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"“守灵人”，你能来到这里，不仅因为你负责纳斯尔纱城内居民的安置，也因为你懂得该如何保持沉默。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"希望你所谓两全的办法不是出于一厢情愿的同情，否则连你也不会再为纳斯尔纱所接受。","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"我明白。","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"如您所说，纳斯尔纱的确无法立刻对这些同胞敞开大门。","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"但我明天预定要去守灵人的聚落请他们送些祭器，既然现在这些同胞无处可去，我可以先带领他们前往守灵人的居所停留。","id":467},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"守灵人的居所？“守灵人”不是你从传说和故事中摘取的一个代号吗？","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"我的同族的确已经被当作故事传唱许久了，能坚持生活在那些遗迹周围的人不会广泛出没于其他地界，我只是离群的异类。","id":471},{"type":"multiline","name":"“守灵人”","text":"正因如此，关于......","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":473},{"type":"multiline","name":"“守灵人”","text":"呃，我们眼前这条红龙的一切，都不会被任何外人所知晓。","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“守灵人”，我很想相信你，但——","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"您真的曾是守灵人？","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"莫兰？","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"我的曾祖母去世前曾要求过一场由守灵人举办的传统葬礼，家里人在荒野上到处奔波，却一无所获，只能把这当成临终者的胡言乱语。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"但曾祖母是个从来都能分得清现实与传说的人，她笃定存在的东西，从来没有错过，何况我也的确听过不少守灵人的故事。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"我愿意相信你。","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“守灵人”，请不要辜负他们的信任。","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"我明白。","id":489},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......好。","id":491,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"“校官”先生？","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"那就去吧。","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":496},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":497},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":498},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":499},{"type":"charslot","id":500},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":501},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":502},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":503,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"涅梅丝？这些人是谁？","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"抱歉在离群后仍来打扰。","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"他们是一些无家可归的塔拉人。纳斯尔纱暂时无力接纳他们，我想，也许......","id":510},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"许多年前守灵人不禁止你离群已属破例，现在更没理由接纳你带回来的不知底细的人。","id":512},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"女士，也许我们并不需要守灵人的接纳。","id":514,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"莫兰？","id":516},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"从前，在我还想做一名吟游诗人的时候，我就在收集守灵人的传说，寻找你们的部落，传唱你们的故事。","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"结果吟游诗人和守灵人的梦都被摔得粉碎，只剩回家这一个念头的时候，我居然真的遇上了你们。","id":519,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"如果传说属实，守灵人过着近乎苦修般的生活，与普通人的唯一接点，就是举办葬礼，让死者的灵魂在火中得到安息。","id":520,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"......不错。","id":522},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"我们只是跟着......不，从塔拉各处归乡的流民，本就不够格被守灵人所接纳。我们只求能在此处暂住一段时日。","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"......","id":526},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"向您保证，我们会最大程度地遵守守灵人的习俗，不会为你们添什么麻烦。","id":528,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":529},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"另外，冬天快要到了，不知道你们是否庆祝丰收的节日。如果能帮上什么忙，您可以尽管吩咐。","id":530,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"......夏末节，这是所谓丰收节日的正式称呼。","id":532},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"看来你们倒确实和城里人有所不同。","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"既然这样，遗迹外有些无人的小屋，你们可以先打扫一下，在那里住下。","id":535},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"多谢。","id":537,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":538},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"mo","id":539},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"mo","fadetime":"2","id":540},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":541},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":542},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"all","id":543},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_243","focus":"all","id":544},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":545},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.8","channel":"stepp","loop":"false","id":546},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"stepp","fadetime":"2","id":547},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":548},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":549},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":550},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":551},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":552},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"涅梅丝，你还有事？","id":554},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"城内的深池要举办一场庆祝塔拉光复的庆功会。","id":556},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"我答应他们来向守灵人请些祭器，既是为了显示塔拉的团结，也为了体现塔拉人自己的国度对传统的重视......","id":557},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":558},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"夏末节将至，我们不可能有多余的祭器。你忘记了吗？就算有多余的，我们也不会送出。","id":559},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":560},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"正是因为重视传统，所以深池才希望能请到祭器......","id":561},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":562},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"那为什么从所谓独立到现在，没有一个纳斯尔纱人来找我们，让我们帮城内的逝者举行一场符合传统的葬礼呢？","id":563},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"忘记后再想起，和只是听说名字，就拿来装点自己的门面，我们是分得清的。","id":564},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":565},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"如果你觉得无法交差，就把这枚哨笛拿回去吧。","id":566},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":567},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“守灵人”","text":"这只是再普通不过的哨笛......","id":568},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":569},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"这是我们能给出的最大程度的尊重。","id":570},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"守灵人不和生者团结，也不需要生者的尊重，除非他们已经死去。","id":571},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"这才是深池理当尊重的传统。","id":572},{"type":"dialog","id":573},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":574},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":575},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read1","id":576},{"type":"charslot","id":577},{"type":"image","id":578}],"characters":["作家","？？？","神秘的女性","红龙","“放逐王”","衰朽的老人","拉芙希妮","塔拉流民","莫兰","“校官”","“守灵人”","严肃的守灵人"]}